{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/3af5bf80cdf2c1351f6fd1671f3dc26b.poster.avif?t=1764149745\" width=600 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/3af5bf80cdf2c1351f6fd1671f3dc26b.webm?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/3af5bf80cdf2c1351f6fd1671f3dc26b.mp4?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>Create dream homes! From 3D plan modelling through to on-site decision-making, you must bring each project to life while giving free rein to your creativity, to take your architectural firm to the pinnacle of the profession.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/a232074dd1cfeb190e69b0e701425ca1.poster.avif?t=1764149745\" width=600 height=98 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/a232074dd1cfeb190e69b0e701425ca1.webm?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/a232074dd1cfeb190e69b0e701425ca1.mp4?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/733171464108e5fc5c5360a8a53dc7ba.poster.avif?t=1764149745\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/733171464108e5fc5c5360a8a53dc7ba.webm?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/733171464108e5fc5c5360a8a53dc7ba.mp4?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Career mode, you set up your own architectural firm and take on the responsibility of managing a huge variety of contemporary home building projects from start to finish, through a series of key stages: <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>FIRST FIX \u2013</strong> Model the walls, rooms, roofs, doors, windows, balconies, etc. according to the customer\u2019s requirements, the terrain, the allocated budget and your creative ideas<br></li><li><strong>SECOND FIX \u2013</strong> Select the floor, wall and roof coverings to maximise the project\u2019s personal touch, and then install the home\u2019s heating systems to ensure a comfortable temperature even in winter<br></li><li><strong>OUTDOORS \u2013</strong> Swimming pools, garages, verandas and more, to wow your clients before they even have the time to walk through the front door! <br></li><li><strong>LAYOUT \u2013</strong> Get the most from every room through judicious placement of the key furniture, to enable your buyers to picture themselves in their future home <br></li><li><strong>DECORATION \u2013</strong> An option for the most creative players who want to try their hand at decorating their house down to the finest details, from a candle on a chest of drawers to the exact placement and colour of the cushions on the sofa!<br></li><li><strong>CONSTRUCTION \u2013</strong> Select the subcontractors according to your remaining budget, and supervise the site, while being ready to react to chance events \u2013 after all, construction work is notorious for never going exactly to plan!</li></ul></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/ea2e0d57e7b65cef3e21dba890063d69.poster.avif?t=1764149745\" width=600 height=98 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/ea2e0d57e7b65cef3e21dba890063d69.webm?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/ea2e0d57e7b65cef3e21dba890063d69.mp4?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/4dd7735a6a6f3e4a2f33ca3b9b2188c4.poster.avif?t=1764149745\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/4dd7735a6a6f3e4a2f33ca3b9b2188c4.webm?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/4dd7735a6a6f3e4a2f33ca3b9b2188c4.mp4?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the construction phase is complete, explore your home with the first-person view! Change the position of the sun to admire the rooms\u2019 performance in different lights, and admire your creations in sublime rustic, urban or mountain landscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/41bb0cdc0884cb7c9bb9e65541221605.poster.avif?t=1764149745\" width=600 height=98 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/41bb0cdc0884cb7c9bb9e65541221605.webm?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/41bb0cdc0884cb7c9bb9e65541221605.mp4?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/d3361faca64934dd2b43dbc2a2ed6ad7.poster.avif?t=1764149745\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/d3361faca64934dd2b43dbc2a2ed6ad7.webm?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/d3361faca64934dd2b43dbc2a2ed6ad7.mp4?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the most of your vast creative freedom with a wide variety of materials, structures and items, and above all innovative construction tools which enable you to design your buildings with precision, from the shape of each room to detailed roof drawings.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/df229689791291f6b8c6523b58378141.poster.avif?t=1764149745\" width=600 height=98 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/df229689791291f6b8c6523b58378141.webm?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/df229689791291f6b8c6523b58378141.mp4?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/75c492c940e3c47e3f7c346e232b6425.poster.avif?t=1764149745\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/75c492c940e3c47e3f7c346e232b6425.webm?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/75c492c940e3c47e3f7c346e232b6425.mp4?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Houses on stilts, green energies, more eco-friendly walls and partitions, etc. Boost your skills with every mission in Career mode and unlock new specialities, to take on ever more innovative home building projects! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/02a3d0c17905e654a1b045c973a3fefd.poster.avif?t=1764149745\" width=600 height=98 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/02a3d0c17905e654a1b045c973a3fefd.webm?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/02a3d0c17905e654a1b045c973a3fefd.mp4?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/cfe4e4051d68e19ff6edd23d1aee281f.poster.avif?t=1764149745\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/cfe4e4051d68e19ff6edd23d1aee281f.webm?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/cfe4e4051d68e19ff6edd23d1aee281f.mp4?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t feel like accommodating customer demands, limited budgets and the laws of physics? Or alternatively, are you eager to create your own personalised missions? Then free mode is just what you need! Choose your parameters with or without constraints, select a biome and one of the 60 available terrain types, then let your creativity run wild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/5a94d31cd2f9dff3c3d9981452ef0504.poster.avif?t=1764149745\" width=600 height=98 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/5a94d31cd2f9dff3c3d9981452ef0504.webm?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/5a94d31cd2f9dff3c3d9981452ef0504.mp4?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/f5ab04cbb5eb429e570bf0e24e13d7a9.poster.avif?t=1764149745\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/f5ab04cbb5eb429e570bf0e24e13d7a9.webm?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/f5ab04cbb5eb429e570bf0e24e13d7a9.mp4?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, some aspects of the architect\u2019s profession have been simplified \u2013 otherwise it would be impossible to play without undertaking many years of study beforehand! The game is intended to be accessible to the general public, and we hope that all players, whether they are simulation, design or architecture fans, will really enjoy taking on the challenges of Architect Life and expressing their creativity.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"a7bdd715b0f0e9eba7d030286096a1c51fad418e.jpg","localized_name":"Learn the Basics","name":"Learn the Basics","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1296400/a7bdd715b0f0e9eba7d030286096a1c51fad418e.jpg"},{"icon":"753c7939dacceeb0cfb21c101279ea913a27a94e.jpg","localized_name":"Archival","name":"Archival","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1296400/753c7939dacceeb0cfb21c101279ea913a27a94e.jpg"},{"icon":"44459e4aa48ccb35a1a906ef41ed551dbfaa9229.jpg","localized_name":"Water's Edge","name":"Water's Edge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1296400/44459e4aa48ccb35a1a906ef41ed551dbfaa9229.jpg"},{"icon":"08fa22415ec7f20b9e4d0f5f647ff5d59bf59485.jpg","localized_name":"A Successful Start","name":"A Successful Start","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1296400/08fa22415ec7f20b9e4d0f5f647ff5d59bf59485.jpg"},{"icon":"130d605717ffebfbc0671badb8dc465ab04b2297.jpg","localized_name":"Main Character","name":"Main Character","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1296400/130d605717ffebfbc0671badb8dc465ab04b2297.jpg"},{"icon":"26460a622554dba76082a8617293b557f4dd0b7d.jpg","localized_name":"Color Mad","name":"Color Mad","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1296400/26460a622554dba76082a8617293b557f4dd0b7d.jpg"},{"icon":"0d4bc232b953e7e662c0d87c1f67743b6fa32199.jpg","localized_name":"Environmentalist","name":"Environmentalist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1296400/0d4bc232b953e7e662c0d87c1f67743b6fa32199.jpg"},{"icon":"405ac06f16bd933235ebf32490ff265391801a2b.jpg","localized_name":"Workaholic","name":"Workaholic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1296400/405ac06f16bd933235ebf32490ff265391801a2b.jpg"},{"icon":"8040f616db63d2538f110d620db91d3c5a4b1f05.jpg","localized_name":"Outstanding Architect","name":"Outstanding Architect","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1296400/8040f616db63d2538f110d620db91d3c5a4b1f05.jpg"},{"icon":"c12333a3a14ec0a0ed6af4d3b834d8282e7dbd9a.jpg","localized_name":"Renowned Architect","name":"Renowned Architect","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1296400/c12333a3a14ec0a0ed6af4d3b834d8282e7dbd9a.jpg"}],"total":30},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1296400?t=1764149745","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764149745","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/2d7f59310e37074665754f3d52b163b55d83f5e3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764149745","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/2d7f59310e37074665754f3d52b163b55d83f5e3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764149745","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>SUPPORTER EDITION</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/62b979e228eec9f55635ef288edb93dd.avif?t=1764149745\" width=614 height=1160 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/3af5bf80cdf2c1351f6fd1671f3dc26b.poster.avif?t=1764149745\" width=600 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/3af5bf80cdf2c1351f6fd1671f3dc26b.webm?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/3af5bf80cdf2c1351f6fd1671f3dc26b.mp4?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>Create dream homes! From 3D plan modelling through to on-site decision-making, you must bring each project to life while giving free rein to your creativity, to take your architectural firm to the pinnacle of the profession.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/a232074dd1cfeb190e69b0e701425ca1.poster.avif?t=1764149745\" width=600 height=98 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/a232074dd1cfeb190e69b0e701425ca1.webm?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/a232074dd1cfeb190e69b0e701425ca1.mp4?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/733171464108e5fc5c5360a8a53dc7ba.poster.avif?t=1764149745\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/733171464108e5fc5c5360a8a53dc7ba.webm?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/733171464108e5fc5c5360a8a53dc7ba.mp4?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Career mode, you set up your own architectural firm and take on the responsibility of managing a huge variety of contemporary home building projects from start to finish, through a series of key stages: <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>FIRST FIX \u2013</strong> Model the walls, rooms, roofs, doors, windows, balconies, etc. according to the customer\u2019s requirements, the terrain, the allocated budget and your creative ideas<br></li><li><strong>SECOND FIX \u2013</strong> Select the floor, wall and roof coverings to maximise the project\u2019s personal touch, and then install the home\u2019s heating systems to ensure a comfortable temperature even in winter<br></li><li><strong>OUTDOORS \u2013</strong> Swimming pools, garages, verandas and more, to wow your clients before they even have the time to walk through the front door! <br></li><li><strong>LAYOUT \u2013</strong> Get the most from every room through judicious placement of the key furniture, to enable your buyers to picture themselves in their future home <br></li><li><strong>DECORATION \u2013</strong> An option for the most creative players who want to try their hand at decorating their house down to the finest details, from a candle on a chest of drawers to the exact placement and colour of the cushions on the sofa!<br></li><li><strong>CONSTRUCTION \u2013</strong> Select the subcontractors according to your remaining budget, and supervise the site, while being ready to react to chance events \u2013 after all, construction work is notorious for never going exactly to plan!</li></ul></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/ea2e0d57e7b65cef3e21dba890063d69.poster.avif?t=1764149745\" width=600 height=98 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/ea2e0d57e7b65cef3e21dba890063d69.webm?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/ea2e0d57e7b65cef3e21dba890063d69.mp4?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/4dd7735a6a6f3e4a2f33ca3b9b2188c4.poster.avif?t=1764149745\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/4dd7735a6a6f3e4a2f33ca3b9b2188c4.webm?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/4dd7735a6a6f3e4a2f33ca3b9b2188c4.mp4?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the construction phase is complete, explore your home with the first-person view! Change the position of the sun to admire the rooms\u2019 performance in different lights, and admire your creations in sublime rustic, urban or mountain landscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/41bb0cdc0884cb7c9bb9e65541221605.poster.avif?t=1764149745\" width=600 height=98 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/41bb0cdc0884cb7c9bb9e65541221605.webm?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/41bb0cdc0884cb7c9bb9e65541221605.mp4?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/d3361faca64934dd2b43dbc2a2ed6ad7.poster.avif?t=1764149745\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/d3361faca64934dd2b43dbc2a2ed6ad7.webm?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/d3361faca64934dd2b43dbc2a2ed6ad7.mp4?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the most of your vast creative freedom with a wide variety of materials, structures and items, and above all innovative construction tools which enable you to design your buildings with precision, from the shape of each room to detailed roof drawings.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/df229689791291f6b8c6523b58378141.poster.avif?t=1764149745\" width=600 height=98 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/df229689791291f6b8c6523b58378141.webm?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/df229689791291f6b8c6523b58378141.mp4?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/75c492c940e3c47e3f7c346e232b6425.poster.avif?t=1764149745\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/75c492c940e3c47e3f7c346e232b6425.webm?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/75c492c940e3c47e3f7c346e232b6425.mp4?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Houses on stilts, green energies, more eco-friendly walls and partitions, etc. Boost your skills with every mission in Career mode and unlock new specialities, to take on ever more innovative home building projects! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/02a3d0c17905e654a1b045c973a3fefd.poster.avif?t=1764149745\" width=600 height=98 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/02a3d0c17905e654a1b045c973a3fefd.webm?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/02a3d0c17905e654a1b045c973a3fefd.mp4?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/cfe4e4051d68e19ff6edd23d1aee281f.poster.avif?t=1764149745\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/cfe4e4051d68e19ff6edd23d1aee281f.webm?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/cfe4e4051d68e19ff6edd23d1aee281f.mp4?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t feel like accommodating customer demands, limited budgets and the laws of physics? Or alternatively, are you eager to create your own personalised missions? Then free mode is just what you need! Choose your parameters with or without constraints, select a biome and one of the 60 available terrain types, then let your creativity run wild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/5a94d31cd2f9dff3c3d9981452ef0504.poster.avif?t=1764149745\" width=600 height=98 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/5a94d31cd2f9dff3c3d9981452ef0504.webm?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/5a94d31cd2f9dff3c3d9981452ef0504.mp4?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/f5ab04cbb5eb429e570bf0e24e13d7a9.poster.avif?t=1764149745\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/f5ab04cbb5eb429e570bf0e24e13d7a9.webm?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/extras/f5ab04cbb5eb429e570bf0e24e13d7a9.mp4?t=1764149745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, some aspects of the architect\u2019s profession have been simplified \u2013 otherwise it would be impossible to play without undertaking many years of study beforehand! The game is intended to be accessible to the general public, and we hope that all players, whether they are simulation, design or architecture fans, will really enjoy taking on the challenges of Architect Life and expressing their creativity.</p>","developers":["Shine Research"],"dlc":[3478930,3478940,3676700],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1296400/header.jpg?t=1764149745","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Architect Life: A House Design Simulator \u00a92025 Nacon. \u00a92025 Published by Nacon and developed by Shine Research. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1296400/133130087/8a239b61ab9f14d131a2acb49580a6ad32c361e0/1750175143/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750320067","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1296400/133130087/8a239b61ab9f14d131a2acb49580a6ad32c361e0/1750175143/dash_h264.mpd?t=1750320067","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_tra